WEBVTT

00:03:29.170 --> 00:03:33.121
Talk about how you had to work
around their complex schedules.

00:03:33.145 --> 00:03:35.306
That shows that you're thoughtful,

00:03:35.330 --> 00:03:37.494
that you're compassionate,
and you know what,

00:03:37.518 --> 00:03:39.746
that is what makes a great teammate.

00:03:39.770 --> 00:03:42.286
Reframing the hardship in your story

00:03:42.310 --> 00:03:46.340
can remake your confidence
over and over again,

00:03:46.364 --> 00:03:47.696
but it takes time.

00:03:47.720 --> 00:03:49.266
It's like running a marathon.

00:03:49.290 --> 00:03:51.526
You have to train and practice.

00:03:51.550 --> 00:03:54.106
Go back and reflect
on those tough questions

00:03:54.130 --> 00:03:55.816
that you need to answer.

00:03:55.840 --> 00:03:59.126
The answers are what makes you you,

00:03:59.150 --> 00:04:00.556
and I have to tell you,